    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hegarty Properties are delighted to present No. 5 Power Terrace, Cork Hill, Youghal, to the market.  Built in 1950, this 2-bed end-of-terrace property is situated in a well-established residential area; conveniently located to Youghal town centre. The property offers an excellent opportunity for those looking for a town residence within walking distance of all amenities. \r\nA particular feature of the property is its end-of-terrace position, large detached garage and rear garden, providing valuable additional storage and outdoor space.\r\nThe property qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to meeting the relevant scheme criteria.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Includes: Entrance porch, Sitting Room, kitchen, 2 Bedrooms and Bathroom.  \r\nApprox. 42 sq. m. (c. 452 sq.f)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch:\tEntrance hallway providing access to the main living accommodation.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:            Front aspect featuring a fitted stove with tiled fireplace surround. Carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nKitchen/ \r\nDining Area:\tKitchen and dining area with potential for modernisation. Rear access. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\tFront aspect room. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \tRear aspect room. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom:\tW.C., wash hand basin, & electric shower. Lino flooring. Built in storage \r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:  \tThe property benefits from its end-of-terrace position, with a large detached garage providing excellent additional storage space or workshop. The garden is located to the rear and currently laid to lawn.  \r\n\r\nIncluded in Sale:  \tSold as viewed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tLarge detached garage offering excellent storage/workshop potential\r\n•\tRear garden.\r\n•\tEnd-of-terrace position\r\n•\tEstablished residential location on Cork Hill\r\n•\tWithin easy reach of Youghal town centre and local amenities\r\n•\tExcellent refurbishment potential.\r\n•\tEligible for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, subject to meeting the scheme's eligibility criteria\r\n•\tBER: F.\tBER Number: 119634210\r\n•\tEircode: P36 TX49"
      },
      {
